  "description": "gRPC and gRPC-Web for Shiny.Net.HttpServer — unary, client-streaming, server-streaming and bidirectional methods served over the same HTTP/2 stack, callable from Grpc.Net.Client, grpcurl or a browser, without ASP.NET Core. Serialization is supplied by the caller, so nothing here reflects over your messages and the whole path stays trim- and AOT-clean.",
